license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code, data, selected campaign and validation logs, and paper supporting a
  large-scale computational investigation of OEIS A248044, associated with
  Sun's Conjecture 4.3(i). The computation determines a(m) for 99,998 of the
  first 100,000 positive integers, with final search bound n <= 10^13, leaving
  m = 19623 and m = 19624 unresolved with lower bound a(m) > 10^13.
